@startuml
title US10 - Register a Test Type\nSequence Diagram (SD)

autoactivate on
autonumber

actor "Administrator" as User
participant ":RegisterTestTypeView" as View
participant ":RegisterTestTypeController" as Ctrl
participant App
participant "app:App" as AppInstance
participant "container:TestTypeContainer" as Container
participant "testType:TestType" as TestType

User -> View: asks to register a Test Type
View --> User: requests data (Internal Code, NHS Code,\ncollection-method description)
User -> View: provides the requested data
View -> Ctrl: registerTestType(internalCode,\nnhsCode, collectionMethodDescription)
Ctrl -> App: getInstance()
App --> Ctrl: app
Ctrl -> AppInstance: getTestTypeContainer()
AppInstance --> Ctrl: container

Ctrl -> Container: create(internalCode, nhsCode,\ncollectionMethodDescription)
Container --> TestType**: create(internalCode, nhsCode,\ncollectionMethodDescription)
TestType --> Container: testType
Container --> Ctrl: testType
Ctrl -> Container: save(testType)
Container -> Container: check code uniqueness
Container -> Container: add(testType)
Container --> Ctrl: success
Ctrl --> View: success
View --> User: informs operation success

@enduml
